                <head>Lend-Lease Agreement between the United States and Iraq<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="ch28-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p>[For texts of the Lend-Lease Agreement between the United States and Iraq, signed
                    at Washington, July 31, 1945, and accompanying exchange of notes, see Department
                    of State Executive Agreement Series No. 470, or 59 Stat. (pt. 2) 1535.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
